# nxt plugin loading paths (UI and config tree)

When changing **board/machine layout**, **SD paths**, **manifest shape**, or **Configuration UI** paths, verify every layer below stays aligned. Canonical SD prefix is **`nxt-config`** (hyphen), not `nxt/config`.

## Path map (must stay consistent)

| Layer | Canonical pattern | Key files |
|-------|-------------------|-----------|
| SD on printer | `0:/sys/nxt-config/board/…`, `0:/sys/nxt-config/machine/<profile>/…` | `dist/build-plugin.sh` rsync → `sd/sys/nxt-config/` |
| Boot macros | `M98 P"nxt-config/board/…"`, `M98 P"nxt-config/machine/…"` — **no `^` inside `M98 P"…"`** | `macros/nxt-config/**/entry.g`, `macros/system/nxt-board-pack-resolve.g`, `nxt-board-machine-pack.g` |
| Build manifest | `nxt-config/board/…`, `nxt-config/machine/…/entry.g`, `machineEntryPath` on **both** `machines[]` and `platforms[]` | `dist/generate-nxt-config-manifest.mjs` → `ui/src/generated/nxtConfigManifest.json` |
| UI helpers | Same relative paths; SD scan root `0:/sys/nxt-config` | `ui/src/utils/nxtBoardManifest.ts`, `nxtConfigSdScan.ts`, `nxtBoardSysDeploy.ts`, `nxtConfigManifestData.ts`, `ConfigurationPanel.vue`, `ui/src/locales/en.json` |
| Legacy only | `nxt/config/<platform>/boards/…` fallback | `nxt-board-pack-resolve.g`, loader `OVERVIEW.txt` check — do not use for new UI/manifest paths |
| DWC plugin ZIP | `dwc/js/nxt.*.js`, `dwc/css/nxt.*.css`, `plugin.json` `dwcWebpackChunk: "nxt"` | `ui/plugin.json`; split chunks need `dist/patch-dwc-build-plugin-zip.cjs` |
| DWC dev | Symlink `DuetWebControl/src/plugins/nxt` → `MOS-nxt/ui` | `./dist/setup-dwc-dev-symlink.sh`; after `build-plugin.sh` run `node dist/regenerate-dwc-plugin-imports.cjs` |

## Checklist (run before considering UI path work done)

1. **Regenerate manifest** (if `macros/nxt-config/` or generator changed):
   `node dist/generate-nxt-config-manifest.mjs`
2. **Grep for stale paths** (expect legacy hits only in resolve/loader shims):
   `rg 'nxt/config' --glob '!*.md' macros ui dist`
3. **Confirm generated JSON** includes `machineEntryPath` on each `platforms[]` entry (partial `platforms` breaks the DWC build → `can't access property "call"` at plugin start).
4. **Rebuild plugin** when UI or manifest changed: `./dist/build-plugin.sh <DWC>` (exit 0); ZIP must list `dwc/js/nxt.*.js`.
   - **Do not** use `NXT_SKIP_DWC_TYPECHECK=1` for real UI work. DWC’s Vite builder runs **vue-tsc**; implicit `any` / index errors fail the build. Fix types in `ui/` before claiming the change done.
   - **Vue SFC habit (recurring):** under DWC’s `noImplicitAny`, Options API often loses inference on `this.*` arrays. **Always annotate** `.map` / `.filter` / `.find` / `.reduce` callback params in `.vue` files (e.g. `(n: number) => …`), even when the array “should” be typed. See [ui-plugin-typecheck.mdc](ui-plugin-typecheck.mdc).
5. **DWC dev:** symlink present; `imports.ts` must not list `nxt` without `src/plugins/nxt/` on disk.

## Plugin load error: `can't access property "call", v[ee] is undefined`

This is **webpack**, not RRF. See `dist/diagnose-plugin-chunk.mjs` for a full report.

**Architecture:** nxt `dwc/js/nxt.*.js` is only ~73 modules; **~45 more** must come from the host `app.*.js` (store, routes, i18n, vue, vuetify). Shipped ZIPs use **`auto-minor`** `dwcVersion` (stamps e.g. `3.7.0`); host must share that major.minor.patch prefix. A different patch or major line → missing modules → `.call` error even if the version gate is loosened. Run `./dist/verify-dwc-build-alignment.sh` before release builds.

**URL resolution (critical on stock DWC):** Host `getChunkScriptFilename` uses `plugin.dwcFiles` when `window.pluginBeingLoaded` is set. Stock app has **no** `nxt:"<hash>"` entry. If `dwcFiles` is empty or missing `js/nxt.*.js`, webpack requests **`js/nxt.undefined.js`** → same `.call` symptom.

**Diagnose:** `node dist/diagnose-plugin-chunk.mjs dist/nxt-*.zip /path/to/host/app.*.js` (save printer `app.*.js` from DevTools → Network).

**Browser checks:** Network → `nxt.*.js` must be **200**; `app.*.js` must contain `pluginBeingLoaded`. Console → object model / plugins file → `nxt.dwcFiles` includes `js/nxt.<hash>.js`.

**Fix:** See [docs/PLUGIN_LOAD_TROUBLESHOOTING.md](docs/PLUGIN_LOAD_TROUBLESHOOTING.md). ZIP must use **flat** `dwc/js/` (not `dwc/nxt/js/`). Run `node dist/trace-plugin-404.mjs dist/nxt-*.zip [dwc-plugins.json]`.

## UI change triggers (always re-check paths)

- New/renamed machine profile or board pack directory
- `sys-deploy-manifest.txt` or homing deploy paths
- Configuration save fields (`nxtBoardPackExpectedEntry`, `nxtPlatformProfile`, pinmap paths)
- New imports of manifest data or SD scan utilities
- Moving or splitting Vue panels (keep **static** panel imports in `ui/src/index.ts` / `components/panels/index.ts` — avoid async `import()` in the plugin entry)
- Any new/edited `.vue` / `.ts` under `ui/` — must pass DWC plugin **vue-tsc** via a normal `build-plugin.sh` (see checklist item 4)

## Release cross-check

Before tags/releases, also follow [release-plugin-verify.mdc](release-plugin-verify.mdc) (macro line length, `build-plugin.sh`, manual DWC plugin load on target major line).
